{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114005","id":3099308439,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc64u7GX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114005","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114005.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114005.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114005","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114005/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114005/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114005/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/691c1941bb23833ed41aabb55fdb734afaa937c8","number":114005,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix EditorSetting presets cannot be set from code","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113440\r\n\r\nSome EditorSettings don't update correctly from code.\r\nAll settings that are part of presets don't work correctly since they don't set the preset to `Custom`, and the value gets updated by the preset.\r\n\r\nThis is mainly theme settings, it includes `interface/theme`, `text_editor/theme`, `editors/visual_editors/color_theme`, and `editors/3d/navigation/navigation_scheme`.\r\nSetting the presets themselves works, except for `navigation_scheme`.\r\nFor example, setting `\"interface/theme/accent_color\"` in an EditorScript will not change the color (Unless the `interface/theme` is already set to `Custom`).\r\n\r\nNow the presets are updated in EditorSettings instead of just in the dialog.\r\nAlso moved navigation preset code to the node3d editor.\r\n\r\nI plan to do more fixes with the presets in another PR (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114090)\r\n\r\nUpdate:\r\n- Also fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99215\r\nThe settings controlled by the navigation preset now update after the usual delay that the notification uses, so the modifier is updated at the same time as the button.\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121861","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undete